{"type":"text","timestamp":1794253423966,"sessionID":"ses_e3e2c9127ffe6YxmFSdPt9SHUV","part":{"id":"prt_1c1d6853c001O0cYWxbCws3HHH","messageID":"msg_1c1d66af8001RHPotqDH007HSN","sessionID":"ses_e3e2c9127ffe6YxmFSdPt9SHUV","type":"text","text":"The todo app is built, but I haven't built the Docker image or run the app in a container.\n\nWhat I did check:\n- **Backend:** I ran a scripted pass through Flask's test client, covering register, login, the 401 without a token, validation errors, `completed_at` set and cleared, paging, sort order, and one user's todo returning 404 for another.\n- **Frontend:** `tsc` passes and `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`.\n- **Not exercised:** the web frontend itself hasn't been loaded in a browser.\n\n- **Backend:** all of it is in `backend/app.py`, with data in SQLite at `./data/todos.db`. I added `GET /api/auth/me` and `POST /api/auth/logout`, which the frontend uses for the signed-in username and sign-out. The new dependencies are all in the Python standard library or Flask, so `requirements.txt` and the lock file are unchanged.\n- **Frontend:** a Vite/React/TypeScript app styled with Tailwind, whose only CSS file is Tailwind's entry, `frontend/src/index.css`. It has the sign-in/register forms and the todo list with open counter, tabs, priority filter, immediate checkbox saves and \"Load more\". It also has the add form and inline editing showing the API's validation messages, and delete with a confirmation.\n- **Dependencies:** `package.json` and `package-lock.json` now include Tailwind, TypeScript and the React type packages.\n- **Tooling:** I added a `.gitignore`, `frontend/tsconfig.json` and an `npm run typecheck` script.\n\nChoices I made that the spec left open:\n- Priorities are `low`, `medium` and `high`, with `medium` as the default.\n- Usernames are 3 to 50 characters and passwords at least 6, and usernames are unique regardless of case.\n- Tokens last 30 days and are stored hashed.\n- Validation failures return 400 with `{\"error\": ..., \"errors\": {field: message}}`.\n- A taken username returns 409.\n- `DELETE` returns 204.","time":{"start":1794253423933,"end":1794253423938}}}
